{"seq":1,"slug":"cac-calculation-channel","title":"分渠道 CAC 计算口径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-user-growth-attribution/cac-ltv-growth/cac-calculation-channel","wordCount":2356,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"分渠道-cac-计算口径\">分渠道 CAC 计算口径</h1><p>&quot;CAC 是 42 美元&quot;这句话几乎总是错的，因为它至少缺了两个限定词：哪个渠道，以及哪些成本算进去了。同一个渠道，只算媒体费得到 28 美元，加上代理服务费得到 34 美元，再加上新客折扣与返现得到 47 美元，再算上平台抽佣得到 53 美元。这四个数字都叫 CAC，但它们驱动的决策完全不同——前两个会让你加码，后两个会让你关停。这篇文章建立一套完整、可比、可复现的 CAC 口径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-cac-是一个商-分子分母都必须定义清楚\">核心概念：CAC 是一个商，分子分母都必须定义清楚</h2><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CAC</mtext><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mtext>Total Acquisition Cost</mtext><mi>c</mi></msub><msub><mtext>New Customers Acquired</mtext><mi>c</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CAC}_c = \\frac{\\text{Total Acquisition Cost}_c}{\\text{New Customers Acquired}_c}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CAC</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3016em;vertical-align:-0.9301em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">New Customers Acquired</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Total Acquisition Cost</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9301em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>分母来自前一章的归因结果，分子来自财务数据。两边都容易出错，而错误会朝相反方向放大——分母偏大而分子偏小的时候，CAC 会被显著低估，进而导致过度投放。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[CAC 分子: 全部获客相关成本] --&gt; A1[媒体采购费]&#10;    A --&gt; A2[代理/服务费]&#10;    A --&gt; A3[创意制作费]&#10;    A --&gt; A4[新客激励: 折扣/返现/优惠券]&#10;    A --&gt; A5[工具与数据成本]&#10;    A --&gt; A6[分摊人力]&#10;    B[CAC 分母: 新客数] --&gt; B1[归因口径决定的来源]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[新客定义: 首次付费 or 首次激活]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[去重规则]&#10;    B --&gt; B4[退货与欺诈扣除]&#10;    A1 --&gt; C[CAC]&#10;    A2 --&gt; C&#10;    A3 --&gt; C&#10;    A4 --&gt; C&#10;    A5 --&gt; C&#10;    A6 --&gt; C&#10;    B1 --&gt; C&#10;    B2 --&gt; C&#10;    B3 --&gt; C&#10;    B4 --&gt; C\">graph TD\n    A[CAC 分子: 全部获客相关成本] --&gt; A1[媒体采购费]\n    A --&gt; A2[代理/服务费]\n    A --&gt; A3[创意制作费]\n    A --&gt; A4[新客激励: 折扣/返现/优惠券]\n    A --&gt; A5[工具与数据成本]\n    A --&gt; A6[分摊人力]\n    B[CAC 分母: 新客数] --&gt; B1[归因口径决定的来源]\n    B --&gt; B2[新客定义: 首次付费 or 首次激活]\n    B --&gt; B3[去重规则]\n    B --&gt; B4[退货与欺诈扣除]\n    A1 --&gt; C[CAC]\n    A2 --&gt; C\n    A3 --&gt; C\n    A4 --&gt; C\n    A5 --&gt; C\n    A6 --&gt; C\n    B1 --&gt; C\n    B2 --&gt; C\n    B3 --&gt; C\n    B4 --&gt; C</pre><p>图中 <code>A6</code>（分摊人力）是最有争议的一项。它的取舍判据是<strong>这个成本是否随投放量变化</strong>：如果某个渠道停投，这部分人力会消失，它就该算进这个渠道的 CAC；如果人力是跨渠道共用的，它应该按某种分摊规则摊到各渠道，并在口径说明里写清楚分摊依据。不写清楚分摊依据的 CAC 无法跨团队比较。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分子-欧美实践中的完整成本清单\">分子：欧美实践中的完整成本清单</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成本项</th>\n<th>是否计入</th>\n<th>常见处理错误</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>媒体采购费（平台实际扣款）</td>\n<td>计入</td>\n<td>用预估预算代替实际扣款，忽略汇率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代理服务费（agency fee）</td>\n<td>计入</td>\n<td>常被漏掉，跨境场景中占比可达 10–20%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>创意与素材制作</td>\n<td>计入（按渠道归属或分摊）</td>\n<td>常被当成沉没成本忽略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新客首单折扣 / 优惠券</td>\n<td>计入</td>\n<td>与全站促销混在一起无法拆分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>现金返现 / 积分成本</td>\n<td>计入</td>\n<td>记账在后续期间，跨期摊销未处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KOL / 联盟佣金</td>\n<td>计入</td>\n<td>与媒体费重复计算或遗漏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>归因工具的额外费用</td>\n<td>计入</td>\n<td>视为技术成本而非获客成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>落地页/CRM 工具</td>\n<td>分摊计入</td>\n<td>无分摊依据，随意归到某渠道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退款与欺诈损失</td>\n<td>冲减分母或加回分子</td>\n<td>两边都不处理，虚高分母</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>跨境特有的三个坑。</strong> 第一，<strong>汇率</strong>。媒体费以美元结算、收入以本币结算时，CAC 的分子分母在不同币种上，必须统一折算并记录使用哪个汇率（是投放日月度平均，还是期末汇率）。汇率波动大的市场里，用不同汇率算同一批投放会得出不同结论。第二，<strong>税务</strong>。部分市场的广告费含增值税且可抵扣，含税与不含税的口径差异会直接改变 CAC 十几个百分点。第三，<strong>返现与积分的跨期性</strong>。首单返现可能在实际发生时才记账，如果分子的统计期与投放期不一致，会出现&quot;投放期 CAC 很低、次月 CAC 突然升高&quot;的假象。这三个坑的完整处理规则见<a href=\"ltv-cross-border\">跨境 LTV 与回收期</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分母-新客定义的三种口径与它们的用途\">分母：新客定义的三种口径与它们的用途</h2><p>分母的选择比分子更容易被忽视，因为它看起来是&quot;明显&quot;的：新客就是新客。实际上至少有三个不同的口径。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>口径</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>典型值关系</th>\n<th>适用决策</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>首次付费用户数</td>\n<td>首次完成支付的用户</td>\n<td>最小</td>\n<td>收入导向的预算分配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首次激活用户数</td>\n<td>首次完成注册或关键事件</td>\n<td>最大</td>\n<td>产品增长、漏斗前段优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首次有效用户数</td>\n<td>激活且达到去重与去欺诈标准</td>\n<td>居中</td>\n<td>汇报口径、跨渠道比较</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三者的关系通常是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>付费</mtext><mo>&lt;</mo><mtext>有效</mtext><mo>&lt;</mo><mtext>激活</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{付费} &lt; \\text{有效} &lt; \\text{激活}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">付费</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">有效</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">激活</span></span></span></span></span></span>，量级差异可以到数倍。<strong>用激活口径算出的 CAC 会显著低于付费口径</strong>，如果两个团队各用一个口径汇报，争论必然发生且无法收敛。规范做法是：<strong>在口径文档中同时给出三个值，并明确哪个是决策口径。</strong></p>\n<p>新客定义还有两个必须处理的边界：</p>\n<p><strong>边界一，去重。</strong> 一个用户在两个渠道都被记为新客时算谁的？必须在归因层面上就去重（按上一章的模型选出唯一归属），而不是在 CAC 计算时再处理。去重的实现依赖身份图谱，其能力边界与跨端匹配的可靠性分级见<a href=\"../traffic-source-track/cross-device-domain-attrib\">跨设备/跨域/APP-web 归因</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>边界二，退货与欺诈扣除。</strong> 跨境场景的退款率与拒付（chargeback）率显著高于国内，COD 市场的拒收率更高。正确的处理是在分母中扣除窗口期内发生退款与拒付的用户（或把损失加回分子），并记录扣除规则与窗口。不扣除会让 CAC 系统性低估。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mtext>CAC</mtext><mi>c</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mtext>Cost</mtext><mi>c</mi></msub><mrow><msub><mtext>NewCustomers</mtext><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>refund</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>chargeback</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CAC}_c^{*} = \\frac{\\text{Cost}_c}{\\text{NewCustomers}_c \\times (1 - r_{\\text{refund}} - r_{\\text{chargeback}})}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0089em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CAC</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7619em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NewCustomers</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">refund</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">chargeback</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cost</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 为该渠道的退款率与拒付率。<strong>注意这个修正对高退款渠道的影响很大</strong>：一个退款率 12% 的渠道，其 CAC 会被修正项抬高约 14%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"边际-cac-与混合-cac-必须分开看\">边际 CAC 与混合 CAC：必须分开看</h2><p>这是 CAC 计算里最重要也最容易被忽略的区分。</p>\n<p><strong>平均 CAC</strong> 是总成本除以总新客数。<strong>边际 CAC</strong> 是每多花一块钱能带来多少新客的倒数，即最后那一块钱的成本效率。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CAC</mtext><mtext>avg</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mi>Q</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mtext>CAC</mtext><mtext>marg</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CAC}_{\\text{avg}} = \\frac{C(Q)}{Q}, \\qquad \\text{CAC}_{\\text{marg}} = \\frac{dC}{dQ}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CAC</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">avg</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3074em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CAC</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">marg</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>由于渠道的规模报酬几乎总是递减的（受众有限、出价竞争加剧、频次饱和），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CAC</mtext><mtext>marg</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CAC}_{\\text{marg}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CAC</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">marg</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 随投放量单调上升，且恒有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CAC</mtext><mtext>marg</mtext></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mtext>CAC</mtext><mtext>avg</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CAC}_{\\text{marg}} \\ge \\text{CAC}_{\\text{avg}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CAC</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">marg</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CAC</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">avg</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。用平均 CAC 做加码决策会掉进一个典型陷阱：当前平均 CAC 是 40 美元、目标是 50 美元以内，看上去还有空间，于是加投 30%——结果边际 CAC 其实是 78 美元，加投直接亏损。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>决策用途</th>\n<th>陷阱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>平均 CAC</td>\n<td>已花的钱除以已得的客</td>\n<td>汇报、横向比较</td>\n<td>用它做加码决策会过度投放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边际 CAC</td>\n<td>下一个客的成本</td>\n<td>加码/关停的临界判断</td>\n<td>需要实验数据估计，不可直接算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合 CAC（blended）</td>\n<td>全部成本除以全部新客（含自然）</td>\n<td>整体健康度</td>\n<td>无法归因到单渠道，不能做渠道决策</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>混合 CAC</strong> 值得单独说：它把自然流量带来的新客也算进分母，因此数值天然低于任何付费渠道的 CAC。它是衡量&quot;整体获客效率&quot;的合理指标，但绝不能用来评价单个渠道——用混合 CAC 判断某渠道划不划算，等于用全班平均分评价一个学生。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[渠道当前平均 CAC = 40] --&gt; B{有边际 CAC 估计?}&#10;    B --&gt;|无| C[做小额增量实验估计&lt;br/&gt;加投 10-20% 观察 CAC 变化]&#10;    B --&gt;|有| D{边际 CAC &lt; 目标阈值?}&#10;    C --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[加码]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F[维持或关停]&#10;    E --&gt; G[每加码一档重新估计]&#10;    G --&gt; D\">flowchart TD\n    A[渠道当前平均 CAC = 40] --&gt; B{有边际 CAC 估计?}\n    B --&gt;|无| C[做小额增量实验估计&lt;br/&gt;加投 10-20% 观察 CAC 变化]\n    B --&gt;|有| D{边际 CAC &lt; 目标阈值?}\n    C --&gt; D\n    D --&gt;|是| E[加码]\n    D --&gt;|否| F[维持或关停]\n    E --&gt; G[每加码一档重新估计]\n    G --&gt; D</pre><p><strong>估计边际 CAC 的正确方法是小额增量实验</strong>而不是曲线拟合：在当前投放量上增加 10–20%，观察新增的新客数与新增成本，两者相除就是这一段的边际 CAC。每加码一档重估一次，因为边际 CAC 本身随规模上升。</p>\n<h2 id=\"口径文档-让-cac-可复现\">口径文档：让 CAC 可复现</h2><p>CAC 的最终产物不是那个数字，而是一份口径文档。它至少要包含：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>分子清单</strong>：哪些成本项计入、哪些计入但分摊、分摊依据是什么、使用哪个汇率、含税还是不含税。</li>\n<li><strong>分母定义</strong>：新客的三个口径值、决策口径是哪个、去重规则引用哪一版归因模型与窗口。</li>\n<li><strong>修正项</strong>：退款与拒付的扣除规则与窗口、返现与积分的跨期处理。</li>\n<li><strong>时间归属</strong>：成本与转化的归属期（投放期还是发生期）、跨期如何切分。</li>\n<li><strong>版本</strong>：口径文档本身的版本与生效日期，历史指标携带当时版本。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>有了这份文档，任何人在任何时候都能复现同一个数字。没有它，CAC 会随着汇报人变化而变化，而指标一旦失去可比性，它就失去了作为决策依据的资格。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CAC 是商，分子分母都必须显式定义；跨境场景中汇率、税务、返现跨期是最常见的三个错误来源。</li>\n<li>分子应包含媒体费、代理费、创意、新客激励、工具与合理分摊的人力；分母要在三个新客口径中明确决策口径。</li>\n<li>退款与拒付必须在分母中扣除（或加回分子），高退款渠道的 CAC 修正幅度可达十几个百分点。</li>\n<li>平均 CAC 用于汇报，边际 CAC 用于加码/关停决策，混合 CAC 只用于整体健康度；用平均 CAC 做加码决策会过度投放。</li>\n<li>边际 CAC 只能靠小额增量实验估计，且每加码一档都要重估。</li>\n<li>口径文档是 CAC 的最终交付物，没有它这份指标不可复现、不可比较。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>CAC 算清了，另一半是这些新客到底值多少钱。跨境场景下这个值受留存曲线、毛利率、汇率三重影响，见<a href=\"ltv-cross-border\">跨境 LTV 与回收期</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分渠道 CAC 计算口径","id":"分渠道-cac-计算口径"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：CAC 是一个商，分子分母都必须定义清楚","id":"核心概念-cac-是一个商-分子分母都必须定义清楚"},{"level":2,"text":"分子：欧美实践中的完整成本清单","id":"分子-欧美实践中的完整成本清单"},{"level":2,"text":"分母：新客定义的三种口径与它们的用途","id":"分母-新客定义的三种口径与它们的用途"},{"level":2,"text":"边际 CAC 与混合 CAC：必须分开看","id":"边际-cac-与混合-cac-必须分开看"},{"level":2,"text":"口径文档：让 CAC 可复现","id":"口径文档-让-cac-可复现"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"归因窗口的市场差异","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-user-growth-attribution/attribution-model/attribution-window-market"},"next":{"title":"跨境 LTV 与回收期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-user-growth-attribution/cac-ltv-growth/ltv-cross-border"}}